## Performance Expectations

| Endpoint Type | Expected Response Time | Complexity |
|--------------|----------------------|------------|
| `/health` | 5-20ms | Low |
| `/interceptor/history` | 50-300ms | Medium |
| `/mcp` (tools/list) | 20-100ms | Low |
| `/mcp` (tools/call) | 100-500ms | High |
| `/tools/*` | 50-150ms | Low-Medium |

**CPU Limit:** 50ms per request (from wrangler.toml)

